; The second vantage point for healthy.test, deliberately identical.
;
; Two nameservers, both authoritative, both holding the same serial. Worth a
; fixture of its own: a checker that reports something about every domain is a
; checker nobody reads, so "no findings at all" has to be reachable.
;
; Keep in step with zones/unsigned/healthy.test.zone — including the serial,
; which is the whole point.
$ORIGIN healthy.test.
$TTL 300

@       IN SOA  ns1.test. hostmaster.propgate.invalid. (
                1 7200 3600 1209600 300 )
@       IN NS   ns1.test.
@       IN NS   ns-divergent.test.

www     IN A    198.51.100.71
